    },
    "10 points per active habit, up to 30 habits (300 points max). Only non-archived habits count." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个活跃习惯 10 分，最多 30 个习惯（最多 300 分）。仅计算未归档的习惯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10 points per unlocked achievement. Currently %lld achievements available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个解锁的成就 10 分。目前有 %lld 个成就可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "100-199 points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "100-199 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1000-1099 points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1000-1099 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10–15 minutes of sunlight for vitamin D." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10-15 分钟的阳光照射以获取维生素 D。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1100+ points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1100+ 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15–20 minutes at around 80 °C. Frequent sauna use is linked to lower cardiovascular and all-cause mortality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在约 80 °C 下蒸 15–20 分钟。经常蒸桑拿与更低的心血管及全因死亡率相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 points per anti-aging rating point. Each habit has a rating from 1-5. Maximum 300 points." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个抗衰老评分点 2 分。每个习惯的评分为 1-5。最多 300 分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 points per check-in, up to 100 check-ins (200 points max). All check-ins across all habits count." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次打卡 2 分，最多 100 次打卡（最多 200 分）。所有习惯的所有打卡都计算在内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 points per day in your longest consecutive streak. Maximum 125 days (250 points)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最长连续连胜中每天 2 分。最多 125 天（250 分）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "20 minutes with bands: rows, presses, squats and pull-aparts. Strength training you can do anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用弹力带练 20 分钟：划船、推举、深蹲和拉伸。随时随地都能做的力量训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "20-20-20 eye breaks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "20-20-20 护眼休息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "200-299 points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "200-299 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 sets of 10 per leg. Builds single-leg strength and balance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条腿 3 组，每组 10 次。锻炼单腿力量和平衡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 sets of 10–15 bodyweight or goblet squats. Strong legs keep you independent as you age." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "徒手或高脚杯深蹲 3 组，每组 10–15 次。强壮的双腿让你老了也能自理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 sets of 15. Strengthens the hips and eases lower-back pain from sitting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3 组，每组 15 次。强化髋部，缓解久坐引起的腰痛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 sets of 20. Strong calves support balance and circulation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3 组，每组 20 次。强壮的小腿有助于平衡和血液循环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 sets, as many as you can with good form. Push-up capacity is linked to lower cardiovascular risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做 3 组，每组在姿势标准的前提下尽量多做。俯卧撑能力与更低的心血管风险相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 minutes of reading a day. Book readers lived about two years longer in a 12-year study." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天读书 30 分钟。一项 12 年的研究中，读书的人多活了约两年。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "300-399 points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "300-399 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30–60 minutes a week of muscle-strengthening activity was associated with a 10–20% lower risk of death from all causes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周 30–60 分钟的力量训练与全因死亡风险降低 10–20% 相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30–60 minutes at a pace where you can still talk: cycling, jogging or rowing. Builds the aerobic base behind healthy aging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以还能说话的强度骑车、慢跑或划船 30–60 分钟。打下健康老化所需的有氧基础。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3–4 week plans for strength, sleep, diet and more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为期 3–4 周的力量、睡眠、饮食等计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3–5 sets of 15 swings. Builds hip power and gets your heart rate up at the same time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–5 组，每组 15 次。锻炼髋部爆发力，同时提升心率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 × 4 minutes hard with 3 minutes easy in between. Raises VO2 max, one of the strongest predictors of longevity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4 组 × 4 分钟高强度，中间 3 分钟轻松恢复。提升最大摄氧量——预测长寿最有力的指标之一。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4-5 stars" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4-5 星"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "400-499 points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "400-499 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 minutes of slow breathing — in for 4, hold for 4, out for 6. Calms the nervous system and lowers blood pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢呼吸 5 分钟——吸气 4 秒、屏息 4 秒、呼气 6 秒。平复神经系统，降低血压。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5-Star Habits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5 星习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
