    "A Mediterranean diet with extra olive oil or nuts reduced heart attacks, strokes and cardiovascular deaths by about 30%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "额外添加橄榄油或坚果的地中海饮食让心脏病发作、中风和心血管死亡减少约 30%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A handful of nuts a day (about 28 g) was associated with a 22% lower risk of death from all causes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天一小把坚果（约 28 克）与全因死亡风险降低 22% 相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A healthy outside starts from the inside." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康的外表始于内在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A language, an instrument, a new skill. Challenging your brain builds cognitive reserve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一门语言、一种乐器、一项新技能。挑战大脑能建立认知储备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A late, heavy meal disrupts sleep and blood sugar overnight." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太晚吃大餐会扰乱夜间睡眠和血糖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A look back at your week, at 7pm on its last day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周最后一天晚上 7 点，回顾你的一周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A moderate intake of flavonoids — about 500 mg a day, from tea, berries, apples and dark chocolate — was associated with lower mortality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适量摄入类黄酮（每天约 500 毫克，来自茶、莓果、苹果和黑巧克力）与较低死亡率相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A program bundles a few habits for a set number of weeks, with a goal for each week. Follow a guided one backed by research, or make your own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "计划把几个习惯组合在一起，坚持固定的几周，每周都有目标。可以跟随有科学依据的引导计划，也可以自己制定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A solid base. Protect one habit next week and build from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基础不错。下周守住一个习惯，再从那里继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A solid foundation. Small steps add up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打下了扎实的基础，积少成多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A strong year. You showed up more days than not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "很棒的一年，大多数日子你都坚持了下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 18 °C (65 °F), dark and quiet. Cooler rooms help you fall into deep sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "约 18 °C，黑暗安静。凉爽的房间有助于进入深度睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 60–75 minutes of moderate activity a day appeared to eliminate the higher mortality linked to long sitting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天约 60–75 分钟中等强度活动，似乎可以抵消久坐带来的死亡风险升高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
