        }
      }
    },
    "After being completed on %lld days, the habit will not show up again this month." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %lld 天完成后，该习惯本月将不再显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After being completed on %lld days, the habit will not show up again this week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %lld 天完成后，该习惯本周将不再显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aim for 2 hours a week in parks, woods or by water — the threshold linked to better health and wellbeing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周争取在公园、树林或水边待 2 小时——这是与更好健康状况相关的门槛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aim for roughly 1.2–1.6 g of protein per kg of body weight a day, spread across meals, to keep muscle as you age." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天每公斤体重约摄入 1.2–1.6 克蛋白质，分配到各餐，随年龄增长保住肌肉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol raises the risk of cancer and heart disease at any amount. The fewer drinks, the better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "饮酒无论多少都会增加癌症和心脏病风险。喝得越少越好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol-free day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无酒精日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
