            "value" : "今日全部完成 🎉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An orange, grapefruit or kiwi supplies vitamin C and flavonoids, two of the body's key dietary antioxidants." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个橙子、西柚或猕猴桃就能提供维生素 C 和类黄酮，两种重要的膳食抗氧化物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anchor your body clock" : {
      "localizations" : {
