    },
    "Anti-Aging Rating" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抗衰老评分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anti-aging rating %lld of 5" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抗衰老评分 %lld / 5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antioxidant Plate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抗氧化餐盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antioxidants from whole foods — not pills — are what is linked to healthier aging. For three weeks, add color, polyphenols and healthy fats to every day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与健康老化相关的是来自天然食物的抗氧化物，而不是药片。在三周里，每天为餐桌增添色彩、多酚和健康脂肪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything recorded since the backup was made will be missing. The data that couldn't be opened is kept aside, not deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份之后记录的内容将会丢失。无法打开的数据会被另外保留，不会删除。"
