          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balance and strength for healthy aging" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为健康老去练平衡与力量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balance high-impact habits with sustainable ones" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平衡高影响力习惯与可持续习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balance on each leg for 30 seconds, e.g. while brushing your teeth. Being unable to stand 10 seconds on one leg is linked to higher mortality in midlife." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条腿各站 30 秒，比如刷牙时练习。中年时无法单腿站立 10 秒与更高的死亡率相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beans, lentils and chickpeas are a daily staple in every Blue Zone — rich in fiber, plant protein and polyphenols." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "豆类、扁豆和鹰嘴豆是每个长寿蓝区的日常主食——富含膳食纤维、植物蛋白和多酚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beginner" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "初学者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best Habit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最佳习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best month: %@, with %lld check-ins" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Best month: %1$@, with %2$lld check-ins"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最佳月份：%1$@，共 %2$lld 次打卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best month: %@, with 1 check-in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最佳月份：%@，共 1 次打卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蓝色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boost daily movement and heart health." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强日常活动和心脏健康。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break up long sitting with 2–3 minutes of standing or walking each hour. Long sitting is linked to higher mortality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每小时站立或走动 2–3 分钟，打断久坐。久坐与更高的死亡率相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring back a backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
