        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用特级初榨橄榄油烹饪和拌沙拉。其中的多酚具有抗氧化和抗炎作用；每天约半汤匙与较低死亡率相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cook from whole ingredients. Diets high in ultra-processed food are linked to higher mortality." : {
      "localizations" : {
