    "Every %@ of week" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周的 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 20 minutes of screen time, look at something 20 feet (6 m) away for 20 seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每看屏幕 20 分钟，就看 6 米外的东西 20 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every check-in counts. Keep showing up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一次打卡都算数，继续坚持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day is a new beginning. Take a deep breath and start again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天都是新的开始。深呼吸，重新出发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every expert was once a beginner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个专家都曾是新手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every habit, check-in, rest day, reminder and program, in one file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有习惯、打卡、休息日、提醒和计划，都在一个文件里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every week is a fresh start. Pick one small habit and begin there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周都是新的开始。挑一个小习惯，从它开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exercise" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锻炼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exercise programs that train balance and everyday movement reduced the rate of falls by about 24%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "训练平衡和日常动作的运动计划让跌倒发生率降低约 24%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expert" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "专家"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export your current data first" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先导出当前数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Falls are a leading cause of injury as we get older, and many are preventable. This plan trains balance and leg strength — the two things that keep you on your feet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跌倒是年龄增长后受伤的主要原因之一，而很多跌倒是可以预防的。这个计划训练平衡和腿部力量——让你站得稳的两大关键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Farmer's carry" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "农夫行走"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorite" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites come first, then the rest in the order you added them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏的习惯排在最前，其余按添加顺序排列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill half your plate with vegetables and fruit of different colors. Each color brings different antioxidants — carotenoids, anthocyanins, flavonoids." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让不同颜色的蔬果占满半个餐盘。每种颜色带来不同的抗氧化物——类胡萝卜素、花青素、类黄酮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filter By" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按条件筛选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish eating 3 hours before bed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睡前 3 小时吃完饭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish with 30–60 seconds of cold water. May boost alertness and mood; long-term evidence is still limited." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "洗澡最后冲 30–60 秒冷水。可能提神、改善情绪；长期证据仍然有限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First Milestone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一个里程碑"
          }
        }
