    "Go to Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前往设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to bed when you feel sleepy. With a fixed wake time, bedtime settles on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "困了再上床。起床时间固定后，入睡时间会自然稳定下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good health is not something we can buy. However, it can be an extremely valuable savings account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康无法用金钱买到，但却是最宝贵的财富。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Green" : {
