    },
    "Habits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Habits: %lld  ·  Check-ins: %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Habits: %1$lld  ·  Check-ins: %2$lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "习惯：%1$lld  ·  打卡：%2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Habits: %lld  ·  Check-ins: %lld  ·  Reminders: %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Habits: %1$lld  ·  Check-ins: %2$lld  ·  Reminders: %3$lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "习惯：%1$lld  ·  打卡：%2$lld  ·  提醒：%3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hang from a bar for 30–60 seconds. Builds grip strength and decompresses the shoulders and spine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双手吊在单杠上 30–60 秒。增强握力，放松肩部和脊柱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health Guardian" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康守护者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health is a relationship between you and your body." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康是你与身体的关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health is not valued till sickness comes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康失去后才被珍惜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hear how many of today's habits are done, and which are left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听听今天完成了多少习惯，还剩哪些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help someone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帮助他人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High Impact" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高影响力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High-dose antioxidant supplements such as beta-carotene and vitamin E did not lower mortality and may raise it. Get your antioxidants from food." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "β-胡萝卜素、维生素 E 等高剂量抗氧化补充剂并未降低死亡率，甚至可能升高。请从食物中获取抗氧化物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "亮点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hinge at the hips to lift a barbell, kettlebell or dumbbells. Trains the back, glutes and hamstrings — the muscles that protect your spine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以髋为轴举起杠铃、壶铃或哑铃。锻炼背部、臀部和腘绳肌——保护脊柱的肌肉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold 30–60 seconds, 3 times. A strong core protects the lower back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 30–60 秒，做 3 次。强壮的核心保护下背部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a day to mark it a rest day — your streak counts straight through it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长按某一天可将其标记为休息日 —— 连续记录会直接跨过这一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold for 30–60 seconds, 3 times. Isometric exercise like this lowers resting blood pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 30–60 秒，做 3 次。这类等长训练能降低静息血压。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold on to a counter while you practise standing on one leg." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扶着台面练习单腿站立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How %@ Score is Calculated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 分数是如何计算的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How It's Calculated" : {
      "localizations" : {
