    },
    "I kept %lld%% of my habits on track this week with Longevity Master 💪" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这周我在抗衰习惯家完成了 %lld%% 的习惯计划 💪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If trying again doesn't help, you can start again from this backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果重试没有用，可以从这个备份重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Improve flexibility and reduce stress." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提高灵活性并减轻压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Improves cardiovascular health and reduces stress." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改善心血管健康并减轻压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a large randomized trial, a Mediterranean diet cut heart attacks, strokes and cardiovascular deaths by about 30%. It is less a diet than a way of cooking: olive oil, legumes, fish, nuts and whole grains." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在一项大型随机试验中，地中海饮食让心脏病发作、中风和心血管死亡减少约 30%。与其说是节食，不如说是一种烹饪方式：橄榄油、豆类、鱼、坚果和全谷物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In progress" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include kale in meals for antioxidants and vitamins." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在餐食中加入羽衣甘蓝以获取抗氧化剂和维生素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
