            "value" : "跳绳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Zone 2 truly easy — you should be able to hold a conversation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "二区有氧要真正轻松——你应该还能正常说话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep it going. Fitness gained in four weeks is kept by doing a little less, not by stopping." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "坚持下去。四周练出的体能，靠少练一点来保持，而不是停下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the bedroom cool and dark" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持卧室凉爽黑暗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the same wake time every day, weekends included. Sleep regularity predicts mortality better than sleep length." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天同一时间起床，周末也不例外。睡眠规律比睡眠时长更能预测死亡风险。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
