    "Locked" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long hours of sitting are linked to higher mortality, but the fix does not need a gym. Small, frequent bursts of movement through the day add up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长时间久坐与更高的死亡率相关，但解决办法不需要健身房。一天中频繁的小活动会积少成多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longest Streak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最长连胜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longevity Master  |  Healthy Habits for Long Life" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抗衰习惯家 | 健康长寿的习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longevity Master keeps a backup of each of the last 7 days you opened it, on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Longevity Master 会在此设备上保留你最近 7 次打开 App 那几天的备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longevity Master keeps your habits on this device. Export a copy to keep somewhere safe, or to look at in a spreadsheet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抗衰习惯家将你的习惯保存在这台设备上。导出一份副本妥善保管，或在电子表格中查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longevity Rating" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长寿评分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longevity Rating System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长寿评分系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low cardiorespiratory fitness carried a higher mortality risk than smoking or diabetes, and the benefit of higher fitness showed no upper limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心肺耐力低带来的死亡风险高于吸烟或糖尿病，而且体能越高收益越大，看不到上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lunges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "弓步蹲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Made for desk days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "专为久坐上班族设计"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain a 100-day streak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 100 天连胜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain a 30-day streak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 30 天连胜"
          }
        }
