    },
    "Maintain a 7-day streak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 7 天连胜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain a consistent schedule with enough rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持规律的作息时间并充分休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain good posture to reduce back and neck strain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持良好姿势以减少背部和颈部压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make half your plate vegetables at lunch and dinner, with something cruciferous most days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "午餐和晚餐让蔬菜占半盘，大多数日子吃点十字花科蔬菜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it harder: lower slowly over 3 seconds, or add weight." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加大难度：用 3 秒慢慢下放，或增加负重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the intervals count: the last minute of each 4-minute effort should feel hard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让间歇训练有效：每段 4 分钟冲刺的最后一分钟应该感觉吃力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make “%@” the one habit you protect. Tie it to something you already do every day, like your morning coffee." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把「%@」当作你要守住的那个习惯。把它和每天都会做的事绑在一起，比如早上的咖啡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
