    },
    "More daily steps meant lower mortality, levelling off at about 6,000–8,000 steps for adults over 60 and 8,000–10,000 for younger adults." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日步数越多死亡率越低，60 岁以上人群约在 6,000–8,000 步趋于平稳，更年轻的成年人约在 8,000–10,000 步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More than half a tablespoon of olive oil a day was associated with 19% lower all-cause mortality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天摄入超过半汤匙橄榄油与全因死亡率降低 19% 相关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mortality risk keeps falling up to about 8,000–10,000 steps a day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日步数达到约 8,000–10,000 步之前，死亡风险会持续下降。"
